WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Start with a public website
Paste a public website URL. GameScam Guard inspects received page evidence.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:09.200
Watch the scan
Progress and the result appear on the same screen.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.600
Read the coverage
One engine performs 20 distinct static checks. It does not execute website scripts.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.600
Inspect the whole redirect path
Threat sources shows observations for the initial, intermediate and final addresses.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.600
Choose the additional scope
Confirm linked-page inspection. The submitted-page assessment is preserved.

6
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:27.200
Understand new threat evidence
This training destination has a simulated report. The expanded assessment explains the change.

7
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.400
Run the built-in self-test
38 selected harmless fixtures test detection, benign controls and security boundaries.

8
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.400
Recognize missing evidence
A simulated provider outage gives an incomplete result, not a claim of safety.

9
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.400
Review the source settings
Know which sources are configured. A completed observation is not a safety guarantee.
